cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or analysis, please cite it as below."
title: "Executive Order Analysis: a source-verified dataset of 1,534 U.S. Executive Orders (1993-2026)"
abstract: >-
  A source-verified, queryable dataset of 1,534 U.S. Executive Orders - every
  order the Federal Register holds full text for, EO 12890 (December 1993)
  through EO 14423 (August 2026), across six presidencies - with structured
  fields extracted by a language model under a fixed schema: subject domain,
  kind of action, tasked agencies, deadlines, invoked authorities and
  relationships to earlier orders. Every extracted claim is tied to a quoted
  span of the source text and verified against it. Published as SQLite and CSV
  alongside an executed analysis notebook.
type: dataset
